-- expect-row: fir is_route[main](a,b,1,5) id=0bf6b29575e7e596 rca3716fe@0 [fact:is_e[main](a,b,1,5)] live
-- expect-row: fir is_route[main](a,c,5,1) id=7c81040a9f36f243 rca3716fe@0 [fact:is_e[main](a,c,5,1)] live
-- expect-row: fir is_route[main](c,a,1,1) id=fccfb6b5e1b22a37 rca3716fe@0 [fact:is_e[main](c,a,1,1)] live
-- expect-row: fir is_route[main](c,b,2,6) id=657cc5be0f63d349 rc09bf798@0 [bi:2 is +(1,1); bi:6 is +(1,5); fact:is_e[main](a,b,1,5); fact:is_route[main](c,a,1,1)] live
-- expect-row: fir is_route[main](c,c,6,2) id=910e1a8347a98ad0 rc09bf798@0 [bi:2 is +(1,1); bi:6 is +(1,5); fact:is_e[main](a,c,5,1); fact:is_route[main](c,a,1,1)] live
